{
  "name": "recast-character-scail-2",
  "title": "Recast: put your character into a clip with SCAIL 2",
  "description": "Finds the person in your clip with SAM 3.1, then renders your character in their place with SCAIL 2 on Wan 2.1, keeping the motion and timing of the clip. Draft runs 6 steps with the step-distill LoRA, final runs 40. Built from Comfy's template video_wan21_scail2_character_replacement.",
